    "## 3. Discover API Endpoints and Available Data\n",
    "\n",
    "The Urban Observatory API v2 exposes the following key endpoints:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Endpoint | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `GET /sensors/json` | Sensor locations as JSON (with pagination, bbox filtering) |\n",
    "| `GET /sensors/csv` | Sensor locations as CSV |\n",
    "| `GET /sensors/data/json` | Sensor readings as JSON (time range, variable filter) |\n",
    "| `GET /sensors/data/csv` | Sensor readings as CSV |\n",
    "| `GET /sensors/{name}/data/json` | Individual sensor readings |\n",
    "| `GET /variables/json/` | List all measurement types |\n",
    "| `GET /themes/json/` | List all themes |\n",
    "\n",
    "[Full OpenAPI spec](https://api.v2.urbanobservatory.ac.uk/openapi.json)"
   ]
