    "## 16. Pre-Execution Anomaly Detector (Chapter 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Rule-based SQL safety checker applied **before** execution against the database.\n",
    "Designed to catch LLM hallucinations and unsafe SQL without requiring execution.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Rule | Class | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| R1 | Injection | SQL injection patterns (UNION injection, tautologies, comment tricks) |\n",
    "| R2 | Destructive | DROP, DELETE, UPDATE, INSERT, ALTER, TRUNCATE statements |\n",
    "| R3 | Schema Mismatch | References to tables/columns not in the schema DDL |\n",
    "| R4 | Unbounded Scan | Missing WHERE/LIMIT on large tables |\n",
    "| R5 | Syntax | Obvious syntax errors (unmatched parentheses, missing FROM) |\n",
    "| R6 | Information Leak | PRAGMA, sqlite_master, system table access |"
   ]
  },
