    "\n",
    "#### Construction process used here (IS-thesis 10-step)\n",
    "\n",
    "Each hypothesis was built using the standard procedure recommended for IS positivist research (Mbanaso et al., 2023, §3.3.5; cross-checked with the Research Prospect 10-step guide and the Walpole §10.1 / Lind Ch 10 statistical-hypothesis definitions):\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Start with a research question (Chapter 1 of the thesis).  \n",
    "2. Preliminary literature review — anchor in IS theory (Chapter 2).  \n",
