    "Each row satisfies the IS-positivist quality bar: *clear* (one IV, one DV), *testable* (named test in the last column), *specific* (operational variable definitions), *falsifiable* (explicit $H_0$ rejected only by data), *relevant* (each maps directly to one of the thesis research questions in Chapter 1).\n",
